## Original Content
Now exiting stealth mode with a $26 million seed round, Keenable has been building a vast web search index for AI agents.

## Summary
Keenable, a startup backed by Accel, has exited stealth mode with $26 million in seed funding to build a vast web search index for AI agents. This initiative aims to enhance AI agents' capabilities by providing comprehensive web data.

## Key Points
- Keenable secured $26 million in seed funding.
- The company is backed by Accel.
- Keenable is building a web search index designed for AI agents.
- Keenable is emerging from stealth mode to launch this technology.


